		// Row sweep (implicit solve along the "i" direction for each j)
		// ------------------------------------------------------------------
		//
		// Again, each i in [1, n-2] is independent in this phase:
		// - V is only read
		// - U, P, Q are written only at that i
		// We parallelize over i in exactly the same way as above.
		// ------------------------------------------------------------------
